 items are formed from magical energy. These items are often semi-incorporeal; weapons made from force often have <a href=\"/page/Ghost_Touch\" title=\"Ghost Touch\">Ghost Touch</a>.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0005375000</span>5,375<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">0.25 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mad_Tea_Party\" title=\"Mad Tea Party\">Mad Tea Party</a></b>, End Chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Maximum_Charge_Tier\" title=\"Maximum Charge Tier\">Maximum Charge Tier</a>: IV</li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Corrupted_Fire_Blast\" title=\"Corrupted Fire Blast\">Corrupted Fire Blast</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Combustion\" title=\"Combustion\">Combustion +77</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Combustion\" title=\"Combustion\">Combustion +77</a>:</b> Passive: +77 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Fire <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Combustion\" title=\"Combustion\">Quality&#32;Combustion +18</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Combustion\" title=\"Combustion\">Quality&#32;Combustion +18</a>:</b> Passive: +18 <a href=\"/page/Quality_bonus\" title=\"Quality bonus\">Quality bonus</a> to Fire <a href=\"/page/Spell_Power\" title=\"Spell Power\">Spell Power</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Fire Lore +11%</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Lore\" title=\"Spell Lore\">Fire Lore +11</a>:</b> Passive: Your Fire spells gain a 11% <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to their chance to critical hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Tira%27s_Splendor_(enchantment)\" title=\"Tira&#39;s Splendor (enchantment)\">Tira's Splendor</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Tira%27s_Splendor_(enchantment)\" title=\"Tira&#39;s Splendor (enchantment)\">Tira's Splendor</a>:</b> Any weapon you wield becomes able to bypass silver damage reduction.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment green\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Green Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Blue_augments\" title=\"Category:Blue augments\">Blue</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Green_augments\" title=\"Category:Green augments\">Green</a>, <a href=\"/page/Category:Yellow_augments\" title=\"Category:Yellow augments\">Yellow</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Adherent_of_the_Mists_Set_(Heroic)\" title=\"Named item sets\">Adherent of the Mists Set (Heroic)</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Adherent_of_the_Mists_Set_(Heroic)\" title=\"Named item sets\">Adherent of the Mists Set (Heroic)</a>:</b> 5 Pieces Equipped:<br />+5 <a href=\"/page/Profane_bonus\" title=\"Profane bonus\">Profane bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical Resistance Rating</a><br />+10 Profane bonus to Positive, Negative, and Repair Amplification<br />+5 Profane bonus to Melee and Ranged Power<br />+10 Profane bonus to Universal Spell Power</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span> and/or <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Shield Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rating\">Magical</a> Resistance Ratings.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Fire III<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Rune_Arm_Imbue\" title=\"Rune Arm Imbue\">Rune Arm Imbue</a>: Fire III: Wearing this Rune Arm will imbue any weapon you wield, dealing 2d6 points of fire damage per hit.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p>Not upgradeable \n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p><i>A strange item crafted by an eccentric arcane. Useful for clearing the area of noxious weeds (ambulatory or otherwise.)</i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #B1D3A0;\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\">\n<p>Description text says Maximum Charge Tier 3, but can charge till tier 4.\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Fire_Rune_Arm_orb.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Fire_Rune_Arm_orb.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"115\" height=\"115\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #D3D3D3;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Blight_Inferno.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Blight_Inferno.png/420px-Blight_Inferno.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"783\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Blight_Inferno.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816163438\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.100 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.123 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5179/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41413/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12931/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 7/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  102.160      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  102.160      1 -total\n 96.76%   98.850      1 Template:Named_Rune_Arm\n 70.68%   72.208     61 Template:IO\n 25.89%   26.452     11 Template:Popup\n 22.30%   22.785      1 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 21.57%   22.039      1 Template:IsLamannia\n 20.